sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor L as Learner
participant B as Browser SPA
participant A as FastAPI /practice
participant D as PostgreSQL
participant S as SQL executor
L->>B: concepts, difficulty, count, source
B->>A: POST /practice/preview
A->>D: bank coverage
A-->>B: can_start + exact counts
B->>A: POST /practice/start (request_id)
A->>D: freeze plan + session + attempts
A-->>B: state + first question
loop each question
  B->>A: PUT /draft (revision)
  B->>A: POST /answers or /submit
  opt SQL question
    A->>S: provision dataset
    A->>S: validate + execute SELECT
    S-->>A: typed result
    A->>S: drop dataset
  end
  A->>D: score + evidence
end
B->>A: POST /finish
A->>D: competency + gaps + release_status
A-->>B: session state
